A BeOS R5 look for GTK 2 / GTK 3 / GTK 4 applications running under the
nested Xvitruvian X server (src/servers/xserver). Installed into the image
as /usr/share/themes/BeOS and selected globally via /etc/gtk-2.0/gtkrc and
/etc/gtk-{3,4}.0/settings.ini (see build/profiles/data.cmake).

